--   **Evaluation of `εAff`.**
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.KFWEps`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem NLogN.KFW.epsAff_spec (s : IState HS) (eR KR NR : Fin HS) (G : Ex HS → Ex HS) (e k K N B : ℕ)
--       (hK : 0 < K)
--       (he : s.top eR = e) (hei : s.IsInt eR) (hk : s.top NLogN.KFW.kS = k) (hki : s.IsInt NLogN.KFW.kS)
--       (hKt : s.top KR = K) (hKi : s.IsInt KR) (hN : s.top NR = N) (hNi : s.IsInt NR)
--       (hB : zsz (((e + k + K + N : ℕ)) : ℤ) ≤ B) (gv : ℕ → ℤ)
--       (hG : ∀ (x : Ex HS) (q : ℕ), q < N → x.ok s → x.eval s = q → x.Bnd s B →
--         (G x).ok s ∧ (G x).eval s = gv q ∧ (G x).Bnd s B) :
--       (εAff eR KR NR G).ok s ∧
--       (εAff eR KR NR G).eval s =
--         (if k ≤ e ∧ (e - k) % K = 0 ∧ (e - k) / K < N then gv ((e - k) / K) else 0) ∧
--       (εAff eR KR NR G).Bnd s B
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** KFW: the exponent expressions of the uniform phase passes
--
--   The uniform phase pass `phLU … εE` reads, in iteration `k` (index on `kS`), the exponent
--   `εE = aE k mod 4`.  For the stride-`K` layouts of the level procedure,
--   `pos i = e - K φ(i)` with `φ : ι ≃ Fin N`, so
--
--     `aEof pos a' p = if p ≤ e ∧ K ∣ e - p ∧ (e - p)/K < N then a' (φ⁻¹ ((e-p)/K)) else 0`
--
--   (`aEof_equiv`), which the expression `εAff eR KR NR G` computes from the run-time registers
--   `eR = e`, `KR = K`, `NR = N` (`εAff_spec`), with `G` the exponent of a given index:
--
--   * `εLit c` (`G = c`): `S_D` (`c = 1`), `ZD` (`c = 2`), `fixG` (any, `a' = 0` uses `lit 0`);
--   * `εTab fR a` (`G q = a (q / f) mod 4` through a lookup list, `f` on `fR`): the node phases
--     `a' (a, c) = a_a` on `Fin mC × Fin (mC^k)` (`φ = finProdFinEquiv`).
